  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett st&#xf6;d till ett n&#xe4;tverk av institutioner som arbetar med j&#xe4;mlikhetsfr&#xe5;gor inom h&#xe4;lsosystemsomr&#xe5;det. N&#xe4;tverket samarbetar om fr&#xe5;gor som t.ex. j&#xe4;mlikhet/equity och f&#xf6;rdelning av resurser n&#xe4;r HIV/AIDS bromsmediciner inf&#xf6;rs. Regionala strategin: kategori merv&#xe4;rde</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to a regional network of institutions working with equity issues linked to health systems. The network collaborates around issues like how to promote equity of access to resources when for example drugs for HIV/AIDS (ART) are introduced in the public health system. Regional strategy: category added value</narrative>
